msgid "IPv6 网络"
msgstr "IPv6 Networking"

msgid ""
"系统支持 IPv4/IPv6 双栈。启用的以太网接口自动生成链路本地地址，并通过 重复地址检测和路由器通告配置 SLAAC "
"地址、前缀路由及默认路由。所在网络必须 实际提供 IPv6；没有路由器通告时不会伪造可连接公网的 IPv6 地址。"
msgstr ""
"The system supports dual-stack IPv4/IPv6. Enabled Ethernet interfaces "
"automatically generate link-local addresses and use duplicate address "
"detection and router advertisements to configure SLAAC addresses, prefix "
"routes, and default routes. The network must actually provide IPv6; without "
"router advertisements, the system does not fabricate a publicly reachable "
"IPv6 address."

msgid "查看与配置"
msgstr "Inspection and Configuration"

msgid "可以使用未修改的标准用户态工具查看和临时配置地址："
msgstr ""
"Use unmodified standard userspace tools to inspect addresses and configure "
"them temporarily:"

msgid ""
"``2001:db8::/32`` 是文档示例地址，实际使用时换成网络分配的地址。 链路本地目标必须带接口区域；也可以使用工具提供的接口参数。 "
"地址和路由变更需要 root 或相应的 ``CAP_NET_ADMIN``。raw ICMPv6 socket 需要 "
"``CAP_NET_RAW``。临时配置不修改持久化的 IPv4 profile。"
msgstr ""
"``2001:db8::/32`` is an address range reserved for documentation examples; "
"replace it with an address assigned by your network in actual use. Link-"
"local destinations require an interface zone, or an interface option "
"provided by the tool. Address and route changes require root or the "
"appropriate ``CAP_NET_ADMIN`` capability. Raw ICMPv6 sockets require "
"``CAP_NET_RAW``. Temporary configuration does not change the persistent IPv4"
" profile."

msgid "DNS 自动配置"
msgstr "Automatic DNS Configuration"

msgid ""
"``reliefos-rdnss`` OpenRC 服务运行 ``rdnssd``，读取路由器通告中的 RDNSS "
"选项。它检查链路本地路由器来源、hop limit 255、接收接口和完整选项长度， 按通告有效期撤销 DNS，接口禁用时清除该接口的通告缓存。链路本地"
" DNS 带区域标识，避免将同名地址发到错误的接口。"
msgstr ""
"The ``reliefos-rdnss`` OpenRC service runs ``rdnssd`` to read RDNSS options "
"in router advertisements. It checks that the source is a link-local router, "
"the hop limit is 255, and the receiving interface and full option length are"
" valid. DNS entries expire according to advertisement lifetimes, and "
"disabling an interface clears its advertisement cache. Link-local DNS "
"addresses include zone identifiers to avoid sending an identical address to "
"the wrong interface."

msgid ""
"服务只更新 ``/run/reliefos/ra-dns``，现有 ``publish-resolver`` 统一发布 "
"``/etc/resolv.conf``。自动模式合并 IPv6 RDNSS 与 IPv4 DHCP DNS，去重后 最多发布三个服务器。显式的自定义 "
"DNS 或 Cloudflare 策略优先，RA 不覆盖 用户的选择。DNS 搜索后缀的 DNSSL 自动配置尚未提供。"
msgstr ""
"The service updates only ``/run/reliefos/ra-dns``; the existing ``publish-"
"resolver`` centrally publishes ``/etc/resolv.conf``. Automatic mode merges "
"IPv6 RDNSS and IPv4 DHCP DNS, removes duplicates, and publishes at most "
"three servers. Explicit custom DNS or Cloudflare policies take precedence, "
"so RA does not override the user's choice. DNSSL automatic configuration of "
"DNS search suffixes is not yet provided."

msgid ""
"当前默认自动地址来自 RA/SLAAC；不自动运行有状态 DHCPv6 地址租约客户端。 网络控制器的持久化配置页仍管理 IPv4，IPv6 "
"通过标准命令管理。关闭可选的 网络控制器 GUI 不影响 IPv6 和 RDNSS 服务。"
msgstr ""
"Default automatic addressing currently uses RA/SLAAC; no stateful DHCPv6 "
"address lease client runs automatically. The Network Controller's persistent"
" configuration page still manages IPv4, while IPv6 is managed through "
"standard commands. Disabling the optional Network Controller GUI does not "
"affect IPv6 or the RDNSS service."

msgid ""
"排查时分别检查链路、地址、路由、数值地址连通性与 DNS；能 Ping 通不等于 DNS 或 TLS 已成功。实现和 Linux ABI 的边界见 "
"ReliefNT 仓库的 ``Documentation/userspace-api/ipv6.rst``。"
msgstr ""
"When troubleshooting, check the link, addresses, routes, numeric-address "
"connectivity, and DNS separately. A successful ping does not imply "
"successful DNS or TLS. For implementation and Linux ABI boundaries, see "
"``Documentation/userspace-api/ipv6.rst`` in the ReliefNT repository."
